      <td>eBPF Kernel Probes &amp; Suricata IDS</td>
      <td>Attaches sandboxed eBPF probes directly into kernel socket hooks to measure packet lengths, rates, and inter-arrival intervals without CPU copy overhead. Integrates Suricata for signature-based CVE matching.</td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-implemented">Implemented</span> Standalone eBPF sniffer &amp; signature matching verified.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

