<div class="card card-warning">
  <strong>Synthetic vs. Real Evaluation:</strong><br>
  Synthetic testing (<code>evaluate_model.py</code>) showed <strong>100% recall</strong> because synthetic anomalies were artificially generated with massive spikes (10,000B packets, 300 req/s). Real-world UNSW-NB15 traffic showed <strong>17.78% recall</strong> because real attacks deliberately blend into normal traffic. <em>Never present synthetic testing as proof of real detection accuracy.</em>
</div>

